title: Learning Programming with GenAI
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Toby
    family-names: Hodges
    email: tobyhodges@carpentries.org
    affiliation: The Carpentries
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1766-456X'
abstract: >-
  AI Carpentry empowers researchers to make informed use of AI.
  This workshop aims to teach researchers with no previous experience of programming the basic concepts and skills they need to begin applying AI-assisted coding in their projects.
  After following the workshop, learners will be able to critically evaluate coding outputs generated by an AI chatbot and plan the next steps to continue building their expertise.
